            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">spa</span>
            <span class="font-label-caps text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">Base Notes (4 - 12+ Hrs)</span>
          </div>
          <span class="font-serif font-bold text-primary text-base">Golden Amber &amp; Vanilla</span>
          <p class="font-body-md text-xs text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Velvety Venezuelan tonka bean, bourbon vanilla pods, and golden fossil amber that leaves an unforgettable sillage.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Application Guide Panel -->
      <div class="tab-panel py-space-lg hidden" id="panel-how-to-use">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-space-md">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-space-sm p-space-md bg-surface-container-low rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/30">
            <span class="font-serif font-bold text-primary text-2xl">01</span>
            <div>
              <div class="font-label-caps text-xs text-on-surface font-semibold uppercase">Pulse Points</div>
              <div class="font-body-md text-xs text-on-surface-variant mt-1 leading-relaxed">Spray behind the ears, collarbones, and inner wrists from 6 inches away. Heat amplifies honey chords.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-space-sm p-space-md bg-surface-container-low rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/30">
            <span class="font-serif font-bold text-primary text-2xl">02</span>
            <div>
              <div class="font-label-caps text-xs text-on-surface font-semibold uppercase">Do Not Rub</div>
              <div class="font-body-md text-xs text-on-surface-variant mt-1 leading-relaxed">Never crush the scent molecules by rubbing wrists together. Allow the top notes to dry down naturally.</div>
            </div>
